구","matched":["AI","Claude","데이터시트"],"score":3.6,"cluster_id":5346,"source_id":19,"source_name":"GeekNews","tier":2,"related":[],"is_update":false,"related_count":0},{"id":6789,"url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50067325","title":"Ask HN: CAD for wood working with LLM support?","summary":"I’m a hobbyist woodworker. I manually design simple things in Shapr3d with a lot of patience when I build things. I wonder in the time of LLMs if there is an effective way to accelerate the 3D model design using AI.. Anybody tried using AI to model wood projects? Any tools to recommend? Comments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50067325 Points: 117 # Comments: 114","publisher":"Hacker News (LLM·Agent)","published_at":"2026-10-13T05:54:01Z","category":"AI모델·도구","matched":["AI","CAD","LLM"],"score":3.6,"cluster_id":6789,"source_id":28,"source_name":"Hacker News (LLM·Agent)","tier":2,"related":[],"is_update":false,"related_count":0},{"id":5802,"url":"https://www.etnews.com/20261013000207","title":"“AI 도입을 경영 성과로”…코오롱베니트, 기업 AX 실행 전략 제시","summary":"“인공지능(AI)를 도입한다고 생산성이 저절로 높아지지 않습니다. AI를 많이 쓰는 것보다 성과가 나는 곳에 제대로 쓰는 것이 중요합니다.” 강이구 코오롱베니트 대표는 13일 서울 용산구 서울드래곤시티에서 열린 '코오롱베니트 AI 전환(AX) 부스트 서밋 2026'에서 이같이 강조했다. 이날 행사에서 코오롱베니트는 '고객의 AX 여정'를 주제로, AI를 '도입'하는 데 머물지 않고 실제 비즈니스 '성과'로 연결하기 위한 실행 전략과 산업 현장의","publisher":"전자신문 AI","published_at":"2026-10-13T04:43:02Z","category":"AI모델·도구","matched":["AI","AX","인공지능"],"score":2.7,"cluster_id":2718,"source_id":21,"source_name":"전자신문 AI","tier":2,"related":[],"is_update":true,"related_count":5},{"id":5110,"url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNOHBQRWNOb0ZaN0pXNjZZZTk1RmQtSmNUR25GQ09HclZnN1d0R29SUXBuUnlySDRDS0dVR1lWMHhIbGJISk0tTnMxVkZSaERzN0ptNzJnQmdRZVU2aU9HUVB5eTBXMmtCcU84ZjdMb0lRQzJJaWJIR05rbTlpaDJhNHVRcnVGVXRrQ2ZyNk9ZVjJQUUJFektxNlpSV3E0Q0d4Qi12ZmlFTGdlUmd4Zl9FRlhIYm9Wdw?oc=5","title":"Anthropic's Claude AI submits a false tip on a Philadelphia unsolved homicide case","summary":"","publisher":"Audacy","publishe